<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 18.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 18.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:    April 18    April 17   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  271.180     271.680     247.020    9.78 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  308.000     307.440     306.830    0.38 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.720     157.210     158.970   -0.79 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.834	46.742	47.182   -0.74 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  442.220     442.400     419.180    5.50 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.385     139.925     141.685   -0.92 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.988	15.962	16.185   -1.22 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.280     215.670     212.430    1.34 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.870	 1.866	 1.888   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.582	 1.569	 1.581    0.06 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  185.445     184.615     183.135    1.26 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
